---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import { contact, site } from '../data/site';
const updated = 'August 2026';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy | Orchard Los Cabos"
  description="What this website collects, what it does not, and how to reach Orchard Los Cabos about it."
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Privacy', href: '/privacy/' }]}
>
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Privacy"
    title="What this site collects."
    lead="Short version: no accounts, no forms, no newsletter, no advertising trackers. Anonymous traffic measurement, and whatever you choose to tell us when you message the farm."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap narrow prose">
      <p><em>Last updated: {updated}</em></p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        {site.name}, a farm business in {contact.city}, {contact.region}, {contact.country}.
        You can reach us at <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a> or on
        {' '}<a href={`tel:${contact.phoneE164}`}>{contact.phoneDisplay}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site uses Google Analytics 4 to count visits and see which pages and buttons get
        used, so we know what is worth improving. It records things like the pages you view,
        which calls-to-action you click, your approximate region, your device type and how you
        arrived. Google Analytics 4 truncates IP addresses and does not store them, so we
        never see yours. We do not use it to identify individual people, and we run no
        advertising or remarketing tags.
      </p>
      <p>
        Google Analytics sets cookies in your browser. You can block them with your browser
        settings or with Google's opt-out add-on, and the site works exactly the same without them.
      </p>

      <h2>There are no forms on this site</h2>
      <p>
        We deliberately did not build one. Every enquiry button opens WhatsApp, your phone
        app or your email client — so nothing is collected by this website, and the
        conversation happens in a tool you already control.
      </p>

      <h2>When you contact us</h2>
      <p>
        If you message, call or email the farm, we keep that conversation and whatever you
        tell us in it — your name, your number, your delivery address, what you ordered — for
        as long as we are doing business together, because we need it to actually deliver
        your eggs. We do not sell it, rent it or pass it to anyone who is not involved in
        getting your order to you.
      </p>
      <p>
        Messages sent over WhatsApp are handled by WhatsApp under its own privacy terms, not ours.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        Buttons on this site open WhatsApp, your phone dialler and your mail app. Those
        services have their own privacy policies, and this policy stops at our edge.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>
        This site is aimed at adults. We do not knowingly collect information from children
        through it. School visits are arranged directly with the institution, and any student
        information shared for a visit is used only to run that visit safely.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask us what we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it —
        email <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a> and we will handle it.
        You can block analytics cookies at any time in your browser.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If this changes, we will update this page and the date at the top. There is no version
        history worth keeping; the page is short on purpose.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
